    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to No. 86 The Pavilion, a beautifully presented ground floor one/two bedroom apartment ideally positioned in the heart of Dún Laoghaire. This superb home comes to the market in good condition throughout, offering bright, spacious, and well-balanced accommodation with the added benefit of attractive sea views.\n\nThe property features a large open plan living and dining room, creating a welcoming and versatile space ideal for both relaxing and entertaining. This area is complemented by a fully fitted kitchen, thoughtfully designed for modern living. There are two generous bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, as well as a well-appointed main bathroom.\n\nThe Pavilion is superbly located in the centre of Dún Laoghaire, placing a wealth of amenities right on your doorstep. The apartment benefits from off-street parking for one car and enjoys convenient pedestrian access directly to the Coast Road.\n\nDún Laoghaire is a vibrant and bustling town centre offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, and restaurants, along with the popular dlr LexIcon library. The area is renowned for its outstanding coastal lifestyle, with sailing clubs, scenic walks, and sea swimming spots all within easy reach. The nearby People's Park is a wonderful local amenity, hosting a popular farmers market every Sunday.\n\nTransport links are excellent, with the DART and numerous bus routes just moments away, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Special Features</li><li> Ground floor two-bedroom apartment</li><li> Beautiful sea views</li><li> Presented in good condition throughout</li><li> Spacious open plan living and dining area</li><li> Fully fitted kitchen</li><li> Two generous bedrooms</li><li> Principal bedroom with ensuite</li><li> Main family bathroom</li><li> Off-street parking for one car</li><li> Pedestrian access to Coast Road</li><li> Prime location in the heart of Dún Laoghaire</li><li> Close to shops, restaurants, and dlr LexIcon library</li><li> Excellent coastal amenities nearby including sailing and sea swimming</li><li> Walking distance to People's Park and Sunday farmers market</li><li> Superb transport links including DART and multiple bus routes</ul>"
      },
